l and other robots. Once he has escaped from the lab, he has to survive on the outside by evading wild animals and his human and robot pursuers.\n\nThe game combines action and adventure elements. In the lab, you can search for and pick up items and use them to find your way to the exit. Once outside, you have to jump and shoot to survive.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/short-circuit", "videos": [{"id": 65642, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "FBoaXDvCG9o", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FBoaXDvCG9o", "title": "Commodore 64 Longplay [127] Short Circuit (EU)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/FBoaXDvCG9o/sddefault.jpg"}]}